[{"client_msg_id":"23102b0b-65d1-43ee-b64b-e14a0382abd8","type":"message","user":"ULXMF1BC1","text":"防湿保管庫みたいなのに入れて保管すれば加水分解を遅らせられたりしないのかなあ。","ts":"1628516822.433200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"thinking-hand","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WVK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b78bc6b4-6066-47c0-a541-6140ffae4a34","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"Yaxiで試したことあるの(直近で付けてたもの)はマイクロファイバーのやつだったみたい\n\u003chttps://www.yaxi.jp/product-gallery/stpad-microfiber/|https://www.yaxi.jp/product-gallery/stpad-microfiber/\u003e\n装着感は純正よりもだいぶ良かったし、合皮の方も試してみるか...","ts":"1628516589.431600","attachments":[{"fallback":"YAXI EARPADS: イヤーパッド｜stPad Microfiber","id":1,"title":"イヤーパッド｜stPad Microfiber","title_link":"https://www.yaxi.jp/product-gallery/stpad-microfiber/","text":"ヤクシーによるSONY MDR-CD900stやAudioTechnica MSR7等人気機種に交換可能なカスタムイヤーパッド。しっとりとした肌触りで上品な装着感が心地良い。サウンドエフェクトはバランス良く変化し、長時間の装着を可能にする。","image_url":"https://image.jimcdn.com/app/cms/image/transf/none/path/se28a796a94d439d4/image/if1f3e6ccea0ad91b/version/1554270692/image.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YAXI EARPADS","service_icon":"https://u.jimcdn.com/cms/o/se28a796a94d439d4/img/favicon.png?t=1531122896","from_url":"https://www.yaxi.jp/product-gallery/stpad-microfiber/","original_url":"https://www.yaxi.jp/product-gallery/stpad-microfiber/"}],"edited":{"user":"U81LLJ340","ts":"1628517095.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YhJI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2509681E-9EBD-449C-9967-A52394844E7B","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"これまでイヤーパッドは純正のとYaxiのを試していずれもボロボロに崩れてしまったのですが、ほかに良い互換部品てありますかね？","ts":"1628515616.430200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z5byI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"672ADE82-1AA6-4CAE-9F86-04DCB406C0D1","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"たまにはCD900ST(ヘッドフォン)使ってやるかと取り出したらイヤーパッドがボロボロ\nパッドを外したらドライバ保護のスポンジもメタメタになっていて悲しい","ts":"1628515533.428000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3HH"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02A1L3SYTC","text":"\u003c@U02A1L3SYTC\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628503225.423700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"2D6C9C26-0193-4E67-A6C9-108135E4C639","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"買ったのは Xperia Ace Ⅱ","ts":"1628477555.422000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qVT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56093EA2-8D7D-4584-8810-7A679405F25C","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"昨日、母親がガラケーからスマホに切り替えたので、色々手伝ってる","ts":"1628477532.421500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":6,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U9S4G0LJW","U017BU3UZBQ","U81LLJ340","U01J7703PFT","U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DM5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2F6B3A16-C4F5-4720-9422-AA208F20D9F6","type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"\u003chttps://pslabo.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/07/20/120928|https://pslabo.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/07/20/120928\u003e\nMacだとこのようなツールも…","ts":"1628471466.418600","attachments":[{"fallback":"pslaboが試したことの記録: macOSの解像度をコマンドラインツールで変更する - pslaboが試したことの記録","id":1,"title":"macOSの解像度をコマンドラインツールで変更する - pslaboが試したことの記録","title_link":"https://pslabo.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/07/20/120928","text":"macOSで画面の解像度を変更する場合は、通常は「システム環境設定」から行いますが、これは次のような操作は行なえません。 よく使う解像度に素早く切り替えたい Retinaディスプレイでスケーリングを無効化した解像度に設定したい 自分にとっては、スケーリングの有効化、無効化は案外重要な要素で、例えばVMWare Fusion利用時にマウスクリックの位置がずれる問題への対処としてスケーリングを無効化するという方法を用いています。また外部ディスプレイとミラーリングするときに、外部ディスプレイ側の表示解像度が正しく行われないケースが確認できているため、その場合の対策として、同様にスケーリングを無効化し…","image_url":"https://ogimage.blog.st-hatena.com/6653458415123409265/26006613601186349/1595218041","blocks":null,"ts":1595214568,"service_name":"pslaboが試したことの記録","service_icon":"https://pslabo.hatenablog.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://pslabo.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/07/20/120928","original_url":"https://pslabo.hatenablog.com/entry/2020/07/20/120928"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U81LLJ340"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vyt3a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0B683CD1-8FC5-462B-99CF-89E8F11E7204","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"macOS、デフォルト用意されている5段階のスケーリングは綺麗に見えますよね。","ts":"1628471365.417800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U017BU3UZBQ","U01AQ5BFNLX","U01J7703PFT"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k=0La"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1fb74b4-6513-483a-a72b-3fb1eda2df5d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あ、そうですね。Mac特有の機能なのでWindowsでスケーリングしたらどうなるのか試してみようかなと言う意味でした","ts":"1628470339.416900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gmss"}]},{"client_msg_id":"457fb32b-212f-4b2c-ab5b-3a450a472703","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://wiki.archlinux.jp/index.php/HiDPI\u003e\n（やれないこともないけど面倒そう。。DEの設定だけじゃなく個別のアプリごとに設定しないといけないっぽい）","ts":"1628469653.415800","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1628469681.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZRFb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f73c8852-d251-44cb-a3bc-d31122fd5a03","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"デカい仮想画面を縮小表示、というのはできないですね\nやるならグラフィックカードのユーティリティが提供していればあるいは、かな?(昔のIntelのドライバがあったっけど、あれ画面の縮小はしなかったか)","ts":"1628469359.415200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ULzMc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccedad7b-24e4-449b-9859-d5a1b76efa1c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"いや、逆か。","ts":"1628469289.414100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VUT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"660b6603-815c-434f-8bd4-e85e445aa0cd","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"アップスケーリングはできるけどダウンスケーリングはできない感じですね。","ts":"1628469246.413800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bRLE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"02bd731b-77f1-46d9-bd3e-a6d1bf039537","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"解像度自体が変わるスケーリングは100%/125%/150%...とかできますが","ts":"1628469043.413300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L7RPu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"026c0bbf-1fef-4dc3-9b99-9c5b0ec492a7","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://tanweb.net/2019/10/27/29025/\u003e\nあるみたいですね","ts":"1628469010.412600","attachments":[{"fallback":"Tanweb.net: Windows 10 PCを導入したらすぐにディスプレイの表示サイズを設定しよう（スケーリング）","id":1,"title":"Windows 10 PCを導入したらすぐにディスプレイの表示サイズを設定しよう（スケーリング）","title_link":"https://tanweb.net/2019/10/27/29025/","text":"Windows ノートパソコンは、13インチ程度の小さい画面に高解像度ディスプレイ搭載したモデルが多くなってきて、見やすい画面解像度に設定してあげる必要があります。今回は「Windows 10 PCを導入したらすぐにディスプレイの表示サイズを設定する手順」を紹介します。","image_url":"https://tanweb.net/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2019/08/ec-windows10-04.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"Tanweb.net","service_icon":"https://tanweb.net/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/cropped-blog-icon-300x300.png","from_url":"https://tanweb.net/2019/10/27/29025/","original_url":"https://tanweb.net/2019/10/27/29025/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tTlKM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c90fb6bf-1edf-42a2-a2fb-0c02d7f8569d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"Windowsにあったかな…？","ts":"1628468976.412200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TCOkJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6c50043b-619f-41ff-9290-d6f1733afbe2","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"どうやらmacOSだけにある疑似解像度っていうやつらしいですよ。","ts":"1628468836.411800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R2+0b"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac0ce143-be00-4b60-bd34-b816657f9982","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"LinuxやWinでも検証してみようかなぁ","ts":"1628468722.411200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iVx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b3797046-ea64-400f-baea-880e9fb42447","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"多分そうだと思います。","ts":"1628468702.410900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WfcB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7abbde45-38a4-4ffa-a547-d384591fdfed","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"WQHDと比べて、文字サイズは当然小さくなりますが、視認性が下がるとかはないですね","ts":"1628468694.410600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lch"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb3baabf-a970-409a-a4cb-136c485a99d8","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"UI要素が全部拡大してるということか","ts":"1628468689.410400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"njnLG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46b5d7f9-7903-4bc2-a026-4c20f4e7d775","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"というかスケーリングだからMacは4kで出力してるのか。当たり前か。","ts":"1628468680.410000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jP4I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1ad7206-b804-4a7e-bc88-db2dfcd5a5ea","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほどー","ts":"1628468652.408900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u/GA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5b3939e-8f00-406f-99f5-68c818964477","type":"message","user":"U01